    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Warp. Shoot. Survive.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The shapes are coming to steal from your base and you need to use all your skills to survive. Warp between arenas, shoot, and land critical timed shots, in order to survive six action packed hand crafted levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475420/extras/ac1f65e8df006a90e05ee2d00627a90b.poster.avif?t=1743750245\" width=800 height=526 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475420/extras/ac1f65e8df006a90e05ee2d00627a90b.webm?t=1743750245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475420/extras/ac1f65e8df006a90e05ee2d00627a90b.mp4?t=1743750245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Special shots and upgrades.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive the SHAPEVASION you'll need to upgrade your arsenal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each level that you survive you will be offered a powerful player upgrade, in later levels you will also be able to select a special weapon to increase your abilities further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The shapes that you defeat also have a chance to drop upgrades to your passive stats, these include improvements to your fuel amounts, increases to your movement speed, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475420/extras/62385d6676c02d34e6765d076385dc09.poster.avif?t=1743750245\" width=800 height=526 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475420/extras/62385d6676c02d34e6765d076385dc09.webm?t=1743750245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475420/extras/62385d6676c02d34e6765d076385dc09.mp4?t=1743750245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Warp. Shoot. Survive.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The shapes are coming to steal from your base and you need to use all your skills to survive. Warp between arenas, shoot, and land critical timed shots, in order to survive six action packed hand crafted levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475420/extras/ac1f65e8df006a90e05ee2d00627a90b.poster.avif?t=1743750245\" width=800 height=526 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475420/extras/ac1f65e8df006a90e05ee2d00627a90b.webm?t=1743750245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475420/extras/ac1f65e8df006a90e05ee2d00627a90b.mp4?t=1743750245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Special shots and upgrades.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive the SHAPEVASION you'll need to upgrade your arsenal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each level that you survive you will be offered a powerful player upgrade, in later levels you will also be able to select a special weapon to increase your abilities further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The shapes that you defeat also have a chance to drop upgrades to your passive stats, these include improvements to your fuel amounts, increases to your movement speed, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475420/extras/62385d6676c02d34e6765d076385dc09.poster.avif?t=1743750245\" width=800 height=526 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475420/extras/62385d6676c02d34e6765d076385dc09.webm?t=1743750245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475420/extras/62385d6676c02d34e6765d076385dc09.mp4?t=1743750245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
